id: pm-review-release-gate
title: Release readiness behind PM_RELEASE_APPROVED
description: "Prepare daily OIDC publishing behind one repository approval variable. Verify metadata, allowlisted packed files, privacy, regression checks, npm and Bun release gates. The owner performs the first npm publish and trusted-publisher setup; keep approval unset."
type: Chore
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-25T23:21:55.347Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-26T01:02:38.208Z"
assignee: codex-agent
claim_principal: codex-agent
author: codex-agent
comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-25T23:22:00.857Z",codex-agent,"Normalize daily scheduling and PM_RELEASE_APPROVED job gates while preserving release decisions, generated changelogs and release notes. Verify OIDC publishing without a stored npm token, manifest metadata, packed allowlists and private-data scans. No open homepage/author PR was found during orientation. No publishing, trust setup, approval variable changes or merges are authorized."
  "2026-10-25T23:50:09.516Z",codex-agent,"CI previously executed the complete npm gate as individually listed steps. Consolidated those steps into npm run release:check so the required npm and Bun entrypoints are both exercised directly on the PR. Retained the explicit identity check and Bun graph-install check; no source thresholds or release checks were removed. Restoring the previous CI workflow makes the new entrypoint regression fail; restored check passes 1/1."
  "2026-10-25T23:52:19.919Z",codex-agent,"Pack verification: npm pack --dry-run --json and the actual npm pack --ignore-scripts artifact agree on 113 allowlisted files (dist: 108; root files: 5). Every packed member was scanned for absolute home paths, npm/GitHub/cloud tokens, private keys, hosted-data locations, private addresses and historical owner email addresses: PASS with zero matches. Regression proof: five independent workflow mutations (approval, provenance, token environment, daily schedule and OR bypass) plus the original manifest each fail the new contract check; restored contract passes 4/4. The linked test also passes through pm test --run --progress. Next gates: npm run release:check and bun run release:check with isolated HOME and Git configuration."
  "2026-10-26T01:02:38.207Z",codex-agent,"Opening the release-readiness PR after package allowlist/privacy verification and focused regression proofs so complete npm and Bun CI can run in parallel with local full-gate verification. Pending checks are explicitly not treated as passing evidence. No timeout, threshold, dependency pin or test case is being relaxed."
files[5]{path,scope}:
  .github/workflows/ci.yml,project
  .github/workflows/release.yml,project
  package.json,project
  test/release-approval.test.ts,project
  test/release-ci.test.ts,project
tests[2]{command,scope,provenance{author,created_at,source_kind,source_ref}}:
